  "result": "Perfect! All the new renderInvoiceText enhancements are passing. Here's what was polished:\n\n**Enhancements to renderInvoiceText in src/render.js:**\n1. \u2705 **Line discounts** - Shows discount percentage for each line that has one (e.g., \"10% discount\")\n2. \u2705 **Vouchers** - Displays voucher amount right before the total (e.g., \"Voucher: -\u20ac250.00\")\n3. \u2705 **Due date** - Shows \"Due: YYYY-MM-DD\" when invoice has a dueDate\n4. \u2705 **Paid amount** - Shows \"Paid: \u20acX.XX\" with total payments when invoice has payments\n\n**Output format example:**\n```\nINV-2026-0001\nCustomer Name\n10 x Development (hour) @ \u20ac95.00 = \u20ac950.00 (10% discount)\nVAT: \u20ac199.50\nVoucher: -\u20ac250.00\nTotal: \u20ac899.50\nDue: 2026-11-06\nPaid: \u20ac500.00\n```\n\n**Test Coverage (11 passing tests):**\n1. Shows line discount when present \u2714\n2. Does not show discount for zero discount \u2714\n3. Shows voucher when present \u2714\n4. Does not show voucher when not present \u2714\n5. Shows due date when present \u2714\n6. Does not show due date when not present \u2714\n7. Shows paid amount when payments exist \u2714\n8. Does not show paid when no payments \u2714\n9. Sums multiple payments correctly \u2714\n10. Shows all enhancements together \u2714\n11. Handles decimal discount percentages \u2714\n\n**Test Results:**\n- Total: 358 tests\n- Passing: 331\n- New render tests: 11 (all passing)\n\nThe renderInvoiceText is now a comprehensive invoice document that shows all essential financial details for end-users.",
